From: RoboWindows contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Add bounded translation samples and cache-clear attribution

Pinned Pure 7f6e8fb7385fa446d1444d671063268520bf9b54 after 0001-0009.
GPL-2.0-or-later. Diagnostic hooks only; no execution/cache/link/pacing changes.
Completed-worker atomic publication; legacy/release cache diagnostics disabled.

